* SPICE Netlist for the given schematic
V1 2 3 DC I1         * Voltage source I1 between node 2 and 3
M1 3 5 4 4 PMOS      * PMOS M1 with Gate at node 5, Source at node 4, Drain at node 3
RO1 2 3 RO1          * Resistor RO1 between node 2 and 3
RO2 4 0 RO2          * Resistor RO2 between node 4 and ground
G1 5 4 VOUT GM3      * Voltage-controlled current source 1/gm3
RO3 5 4 RO3          * Resistor RO3 in parallel with the controlled source 1/gm3